=== X1  FINDING 3: the SAME exit code with NO receipt must park, not withdraw ===
  91 is this product's 'no effect landed' code. A worker that emits it by
  accident -- which is what any sysexits-speaking tool in the pipeline does
  -- must NOT have its intent withdrawn, or the retry duplicates the effect.
  That is exactly what 76 (=EX_PROTOCOL) did before this fix.
