=== X3  FINDING 4: the instrument counts INVOCATIONS, not record contents ===
  A worker whose record carries an invocation identity -- task=... msg_id=...
  as any real effect log does -- used to make two executions of ONE task
  read as two DISTINCT effects and zero duplicates. The instrument went
  green on the very failure it exists to catch.
  the two records, byte-different by construction:
    task=t-p msg_id=2628352-1786382145812382715
    task=t-p msg_id=2625786-1786382140726359649
  distinct CONTENTS = 2  (2 -- which is why content cannot be the identity)
